  "translations": {
    "错拍灯阵": "Out of Time",
    "三盏火各数各的拍，安全的一拍也会变。": "Each fire keeps its own beat; a safe moment never lasts.",
    "在空位观察火势 · 横纵交替穿行 · 每盏火重新计时": "Watch from the safe pockets · cross on alternating axes · read every fire afresh",
    "别沿用上一盏火的节奏 · 熄灭时再穿过低檐": "Do not reuse the last fire’s timing · cross the low eave while it is dark",
    "看准不同火阵节拍 · 合踩开门 · 乘末段风柱登灯台": "Time each fire pulse, hold the gate plates, then climb the final updraft."
  },
